{"by":"raj-shekhar","descendants":46,"id":50548161,"kids":[50549182,50552001,50554314,50549848,50549455,50552409,50553721,50554934,50549964,50549054,50553616,50548765,50551738,50549560,50551400,50550140,50551042,50550130,50548932,50548976,50551524],"score":187,"text":"Voyager 1 reached one light-day from Earth today.<p>On the site you can:<p>- see where both Voyagers are right now<p>- open a nuclear battery to its 24 plutonium spheres<p>- go into the data computer, down to a single memory chip<p>- see how the Golden Record&#x27;s cover explains how to play it<p>- watch how Voyager 1 was fixed by radio<p>- see which dish on Earth is listening to them, live<p>I also made a 4-minute film from it: <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.youtube.com&#x2F;watch?v=kpzsRo-c1_A\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.youtube.com&#x2F;watch?v=kpzsRo-c1_A</a>","time":1795018731,"title":"Show HN: Take Voyager 1 apart, down to a single memory chip","type":"story","url":"https://rshekhar.com/voyager/"}
